# Sent on every response, so the signal survives a crawler that never fetches
# robots.txt. Advisory like robots.txt is — the access policy in front of the
# project is what actually keeps the site unread.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, noai, noimageai
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
